STYLE='''Production fighting-game PIXEL ART matching the attached existing combat sprite: stepped crisp pixels, black outlines, limited compact shading, no vector smoothness. Each cell contains exactly ONE complete actor facing RIGHT in the same three-quarter view. Preserve exact head shape, eye count, colors, clothing, held weapons, accessories, body proportions and connected anatomy from reference. Do NOT redesign or simplify face. Draw full body, hands, feet and all attached accessories inside each cell with generous empty margins. Same scale and head size throughout. Solid pure MAGENTA #ff00ff background, no labels, text, grid lines, shadows, floor stripe, floating effects or opponents. Never draw a companion. The attached sheet contains the ONE selected body only; copy its current design. No graphic injury or gore.'''
